  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Projet d&#x2019;assistance multisectorielle en documentation civile et en abris d&#x2019;urgence aux personnes affect&#xe9;s par le d&#xe9;placement forc&#xe9; au centre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide life-saving protection, shelter and essential household item assistance to internally placed person, refugees and host community members in Bandigara and Mopti. This UNHCR project provides over $520,000 directly to households in need via cash transfers, distributes essential household item and shelter kits, and supports households in obtaining legal documentation. The protection component of the project provides humanitarian assistance to 44,500 people, including 10,300 women, 8,300 men, 25,900 children, and including 900 persons with disabilities. The shelter and essential household item component provides humanitarian assistance to 5,600 people, including 1,100 women, 1,100 men, 3,400 children, and including 300 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
